answer_text:
The only workaround I found is to disable caching in the MindsDB configuration:

```json
{
  "cache": {
    "type": "none"
  }
}
```

Reference: https://docs.mindsdb.com/setup/custom-config#cache

This confirms the issue is related to global caching of table lists between agent executions. However, disabling cache entirely is not an ideal solution as it impacts performance for other operations.

