> [@Alex-xd](https://github.com/Alex-xd) Has setting the `MINDSDB_A2A_HOST` variable resolved this problem?

@martyna-mindsdb No, only partially solved. As the image I posted, you can see the request url sent from front-end page is incorrect on the http protocol(hardcoded “http”).

Also, in cloud deployment, normally we don’t expose port 47338 to client due to security reason, so all requests to servers must go through port 443(or 80), and we route them to real port(47338) on server side.

